{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_7000_situation", "source_sha256": "6ca68b16ae01705b86439f4cf00794bc601cf04ecd0ee2e97cbd5ceafed93d65", "ja": "グラビア撮影のお仕事　撮影前", "zh": "写真拍摄的工作　拍摄前", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_7000_place", "source_sha256": "f1860edaa8a9578fc2484c89f70aff5f4be5b8e448a9efe39fa4812250ca02c2", "ja": "撮影スタジオ", "zh": "摄影棚", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_7001_p", "source_sha256": "6389597e65ddfaf081802824cf11e371b16b05e6ea7140eea082885e4d540a00", "ja": "（グラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の企画で、歩は\n『小悪魔』をテーマに撮影することになったが……）", "zh": "（在写真杂志《アイグラ！！》的企划中，步要以“小恶魔”为主题进行拍摄，可是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_7002_034ayu", "source_sha256": "7ee9686e0e42d778e25fed3fb4277a1659d23fa9472a56267d8d41eb8064f423", "ja": "マイガー！　小悪魔的なカワイさとか言われても……\nうぅ、アタシには無理だってばぁ～……！", "zh": "天哪！就算说什么小恶魔般的可爱……\n呜呜，我都说了我做不到啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_7003_p", "source_sha256": "de744e14f620568b99130e64c390ca54f69181e06ec212d3944b758191e3e9d4", "ja": "なんというか……だいぶ苦戦してるみたいだな。", "zh": "总觉得……好像相当不顺利啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_7004_034ayu", "source_sha256": "1bfddc28afeff0c1ae5dd70f9d90670556a1e9c19d8291aaf2bfbb3eb06e8704", "ja": "苦戦どころじゃないよ。小悪魔って簡単にいうけどさ。\nようは、美希とか翼みたいな感じってことでしょ？", "zh": "哪是苦战啊。虽说轻易地称作小恶魔。说到底，就是像美希和翼那样，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_7005_034ayu", "source_sha256": "a5df3f8c49722a51e23d9f2de507c28265de4913bb5c60b63fb2885a02fcc679", "ja": "なんとなくはわかるけど……でもアタシがやるって\nいうのはまた別！　やっぱり恥ずかしいんだよね……。", "zh": "虽然大概能理解……但要我来做又是另一回事！果然还是会觉得害羞啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_7006_p", "source_sha256": "f08b3c0d65846ecb0401c7318cba85fc5b1822922d536017512289454cdd3c4e", "ja": "なるほど……苦戦の原因は、恥ずかしさか。\nそれなら少し考え方を変えてみよう！", "zh": "原来如此……难以应付的原因是害羞啊。\n既然这样，那就稍微换个思路吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_7007", "source_sha256": "536e251784c9cce460569d11ff432198090dcd914e26bf5de3663589dad9c623", "ja": "自信を持とう", "zh": "要有自信", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_7008", "source_sha256": "07125b43048961bb3ba83f981cc929e5c2544a4d022bfb04cf34d68a6358d563", "ja": "挑発してみる", "zh": "试着挑衅一下", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_7200_p", "source_sha256": "ece9e13aceb059c398b45fe446a49c44d1837bf75bf4089dfd470a4f4ee5f592", "ja": "とにかく自分を信じる！　歩には小悪魔的な可愛さが\n既に備わってる！　大丈夫だ！　自信を持とう！", "zh": "总之要相信自己！步本来就已经\n具备了小恶魔般的可爱！没事的！自信点！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_7201_034ayu", "source_sha256": "bd945b74bc5d6049b11a8dea543fa1ccfd6c8b54efea50528831323265344f13", "ja": "ええっ！？　きゅ、急になに言うんだよっ！？\nアタシにそんなカワイさなんて……。", "zh": "诶！？突、突然说什么啊！？\n我哪有那么可爱……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_7202_034ayu", "source_sha256": "f879fcb23770b5511050044c71b55763c35dee0adcf3aa2d2beb77949a28d44d", "ja": "いや！　でも{$P$}が言うなら\nそうなんだよな！　自分を信じて思い切りやってみる！", "zh": "不！不过既然{$P$}这么说，那一定就是这样！相信自己，放手一搏吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_7300_p", "source_sha256": "ece9e13aceb059c398b45fe446a49c44d1837bf75bf4089dfd470a4f4ee5f592", "ja": "とにかく自分を信じる！　歩には小悪魔的な可愛さが\n既に備わってる！　大丈夫だ！　自信を持とう！", "zh": "总之要相信自己！步本来就已经\n具备了小恶魔般的可爱！没事的！自信点！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_7301_034ayu", "source_sha256": "61bedec6ad3751338c3ac0f3901106a55e1c2b4f5ad4ef7abd0a4f326f2b152f", "ja": "そ、そうなのかな？　よし……アタシは小悪魔みたいな\nカワイさがある……アタシは、小悪魔……！", "zh": "是、是这样吗？好……我有着小恶魔般的可爱……我是小恶魔……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_7302_034ayu", "source_sha256": "98e98e31bd586ddadf6b9662731701b23b309c652f74a5858d9948f78910bc4e", "ja": "そんなこと言われてもやっぱ無理～！\n何か別の方法とかないの！？", "zh": "就算你这么说，果然还是不行啦～！\n没有别的办法了吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_7500_p", "source_sha256": "fbe6dd5b590c59d03ad0fd5c205237098b401339898d3f40e99a59d9a57310e5", "ja": "ライブで観客を煽ったりするだろう？\n小悪魔の行動も相手を挑発してると思えば……。", "zh": "在演出时你也会去煽动观众的情绪吧？\n如果把小恶魔的举动也当作是在挑衅对方的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_7501_034ayu", "source_sha256": "9e853eaddab472d0ddb4539c42f8eac053de05d85135e0df323fa67f415db1b8", "ja": "たしかに～！　そっか、挑発的に……。\nそれなら、アタシらしい小悪魔感が出せるかも。", "zh": "确实～！这样啊，要走挑衅路线……  \n那样的话，说不定就能表现出属于我的小恶魔感了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_7502_034ayu", "source_sha256": "fc7e6345c1f42b1764ab101a5cee7ded8b790978f80c40774969a2fa65c1a5d6", "ja": "へへっ。なんか、できそうな気がしてきたよ！\nありがとうね、{$P$}♪", "zh": "嘿嘿，我感觉好像能做到了！\n谢谢你，{$P$}♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_7600_p", "source_sha256": "fbe6dd5b590c59d03ad0fd5c205237098b401339898d3f40e99a59d9a57310e5", "ja": "ライブで観客を煽ったりするだろう？\n小悪魔の行動も相手を挑発してると思えば……。", "zh": "在演出时你也会去煽动观众的情绪吧？\n如果把小恶魔的举动也当作是在挑衅对方的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_7601_034ayu", "source_sha256": "895a902a7d4aa28c79ed14073ce19a18c96eec6d884ba9d070c314caa74ddf12", "ja": "そう、かも？　まあ、煽るだけならできるけど……。\nいつもはライブでテンションが上がってるからなぁ。", "zh": "好像是吧？不过，要说挑衅的话倒是做得到……毕竟平时在演唱会上情绪都很高涨嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_7602_034ayu", "source_sha256": "7b05fb7b1e895a349e35d741f4fd56ff0805ea5b71b72c776ebb3452fa55ef47", "ja": "そんなんで小悪魔的なカワイさになるのかな……？\nうーん……なんか違う気がするんだけど。", "zh": "这样就能变得像小恶魔一样可爱吗……？\n唔……总觉得有哪里不太对。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
